# Barbecue Pork Ribs (2 racks)
> the Cooking for Engineers card this notation is modelled on
* buy charcoal the day before

- glaze over medium heat 3 min each side (repeat until the sauce is used up)
  * prepare grill for direct medium heat
  - smoke 1,5-2,5 h (rotate every 20 min, baby back 1,5 h, spare 2,5 h)
    * prepare grill for indirect low heat
    - refrigerate 12 h
      - rub
        - remove membrane
          - Ribs (baby back or spare): 2 racks
        - Spice rub: 1 cup
    - heat on grill until smoking
      - soak in water 1 h
        - Wood chips: 2 cups
  - Barbecue sauce: 1 cup
